 7 |     let mut $out: os::stdout.unbuffered = os::stdout();
   |                                           ^^^^^^^^^^
 what: `os::stdout()` says which kind it is
 why:  `os::stdout` and `os::stderr` say which kind they are: `.buffered(room: 1024 bytes)` writes in chunks and is finished with `os::done`, and `.unbuffered()` writes each print straight away (D273)
